    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="about_version">Version %1$s (%2$d) · build %3$s</string>
    <string name="about_what">What this is</string>
    <string name="about_what_text">A port of the ideas behind zapret (bol-van) and the zapret-discord-youtube / zapret-discord-youtube-linux bundles to Android without root. Instead of a WinDivert driver or NFQUEUE it uses the stock VpnService: the app raises a tunnel, runs its own TCP/IP stack and repacks the first bytes of the TLS handshake so the DPI never sees the SNI.</string>
    <string name="about_matrix">What is available without root</string>
    <string name="about_credits">Credits</string>
    <string name="about_license">License</string>
    <string name="about_license_text">GPL-3.0 — same as upstream zapret.</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer">Disclaimer</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer_text">This app is meant to restore access to legal content that was blocked unlawfully. The authors are not responsible for how it is used. Circumventing DPI may be restricted by the laws of your country — check local regulations.</string>

